<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<article class="legal">
  <h1>Cookies</h1>
  <p>We only use cookies that the site needs to work. Optional cookies (analytics or marketing) are only set if you accept them. The site currently uses none.</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Set by</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>gb_consent</code></td><td>This site</td><td>Remembers your cookie choice</td><td>6 months</td><td>Necessary</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>__stripe_mid</code>, <code>__stripe_sid</code></td><td>Stripe</td><td>Fraud prevention while you save or confirm a payment method. Only set on the payment pages.</td><td>1 year / 30 minutes</td><td>Necessary</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <% if (assistantEnabled) { %>
  <p>The shopping assistant keeps your chat in your browser's session storage (<code>gb_assistant_chat</code>) so it survives moving between pages. It isn't a cookie, it's deleted when you close the tab, and it's only sent to us together with a new question.</p>
  <% } %>
  <p>Stripe may also set cookies on its own domains in the payment form and during bank authentication (3-D Secure or iDEAL). See <a href="https://stripe.com/cookie-settings" rel="noopener">Stripe's cookie policy</a>.</p>
  <p><button type="button" class="secondary" data-cookie-settings>Change cookie settings</button></p>
</article>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
